From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:22:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Rename Call-Barring-Infor-List to Call-Barring-Info

3GPP TS 29.272 defines AVP 1488 (vendor 10415) as Call-Barring-Info:
clause 7.3.101 (heading, prose and the 'Call-Barring-Info ::= <AVP
header: 1488 10415>' rule), table 7.3.1/1, and the Subscription-Data
body in clause 7.3.2. Checked against V18.7.0.

Renaming an AVP renames its display filter field
(diameter.Call-Barring-Infor-List becomes diameter.Call-Barring-Info),
so saved filters and profiles using the old name need updating.
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..15b13c3 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -5150,7 +5150,7 @@
 				<gavp name="APN-OI-Replacement"/>
 				<gavp name="LCS-Info"/>
 				<gavp name="Teleservice-List"/>
-				<gavp name="Call-Barring-Infor-List"/>
+				<gavp name="Call-Barring-Info"/>
 				<gavp name="3GPP-Charging-Characteristics"/>
 				<gavp name="AMBR"/>
 				<gavp name="APN-Configuration-Profile"/>
@@ -5623,7 +5623,7 @@
 		<avp name="TS-Code" code="1487" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<type type-name="OctetString"/>
 		</avp>
-		<avp name="Call-Barring-Infor-List" code="1488" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
+		<avp name="Call-Barring-Info" code="1488" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<grouped>
 				<gavp name="SS-Code"/>
 			</grouped>
